  "source": "reader.html 的 #knowledge-point innerHTML（原样，未加工）",
  "html": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\">\n          <span class=\"breadcrumb__item\">七年级（上）</span>\n          <span class=\"breadcrumb__sep\">／</span>\n          <a class=\"breadcrumb__item\" href=\"chapter.html\" data-dom-id=\"open-chapter\">第一章 有理数</a>\n          <span class=\"breadcrumb__sep\">／</span>\n          <span class=\"breadcrumb__item\">1.2 有理数</span>\n        </nav>\n\n        <p class=\"kp-index\">知识点 2</p>\n        <h1 class=\"kp-title\">数轴</h1>\n\n        <p class=\"kp-def\">规定了原点、正方向、单位长度的直线叫做数轴。</p>\n\n        <figure class=\"axis-figure\">\n          <svg class=\"axis-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 110\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"axis-title axis-desc\">\n            <title id=\"axis-title\">数轴示意图</title>\n            <desc id=\"axis-desc\">一条水平数轴，标出 −3 到 3 的整数点，并在 −2 与 3 处各有一个实心圆点。</desc>\n            <line class=\"axis-line\" x1=\"14\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"532\" y2=\"64\"></line>\n            <path class=\"axis-arrow\" d=\"M548 64 L532 57.5 L532 70.5 Z\"></path>\n            <line class=\"axis-tick\" x1=\"40\" y1=\"57\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"71\"></line>\n            <line class=\"axis-tick\" x1=\"120\" y1=\"57\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"71\"></line>\n            <line class=\"axis-tick\" x1=\"200\" y1=\"57\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"71\"></line>\n            <line class=\"axis-origin-tick\" x1=\"280\" y1=\"53\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"75\"></line>\n            <line class=\"axis-tick\" x1=\"360\" y1=\"57\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"71\"></line>\n            <line class=\"axis-tick\" x1=\"440\" y1=\"57\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"71\"></line>\n            <line class=\"axis-tick\" x1=\"520\" y1=\"57\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"71\"></line>\n            <circle class=\"axis-dot\" cx=\"120\" cy=\"64\" r=\"4.5\"></circle>\n            <circle class=\"axis-dot\" cx=\"520\" cy=\"64\" r=\"4.5\"></circle>\n            <text x=\"40\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−3</text>\n            <text x=\"120\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text>\n            <text x=\"200\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−1</text>\n            <text class=\"axis-num--origin\" x=\"280\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text>\n            <text x=\"360\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n            <text x=\"440\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n            <text x=\"520\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n          </svg>\n          <figcaption class=\"axis-caption\">−2 与 3 在数轴上的位置</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n\n        <section class=\"kp-block\">\n          <h3 class=\"kp-h3\">三要素</h3>\n          <div class=\"triple\">\n            <div class=\"triple__item\">\n              <p class=\"triple__title\">原点</p>\n              <p class=\"triple__desc\">数轴上的 0 点，是正数与负数的分界点。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"triple__item\">\n              <p class=\"triple__title\">正方向</p>\n              <p class=\"triple__desc\">通常规定向右为正方向，用箭头表示。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"triple__item\">\n              <p class=\"triple__title\">单位长度</p>\n              <p class=\"triple__desc\">取适当长度作为单位长度，刻度要均匀。</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"kp-block\">\n          <h3 class=\"kp-h3\">要点</h3>\n          <ol class=\"points-list\">\n            <li class=\"points-list__item\">\n              <span class=\"points-list__num\">1</span>\n              <p class=\"points-list__text\">原点、正方向、单位长度称为数轴的三要素，三者缺一不可。</p>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"points-list__item\">\n              <span class=\"points-list__num\">2</span>\n              <p class=\"points-list__text\">设 <i class=\"m\">a</i> 是一个正数，则数轴上表示数 <i class=\"m\">a</i> 的点在原点的右边，与原点的距离是 <i class=\"m\">a</i> 个单位长度。</p>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"points-list__item\">\n              <span class=\"points-list__num\">3</span>\n              <p class=\"points-list__text\">表示数 <i class=\"m\">−a</i> 的点在原点的左边，与原点的距离是 <i class=\"m\">a</i> 个单位长度。</p>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"points-list__item\">\n              <span class=\"points-list__num\">4</span>\n              <p class=\"points-list__text\">任何一个有理数都可以用数轴上的一个点表示。</p>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n        </section>\n\n        <div class=\"end-mark\">\n          <div class=\"end-mark__rule\"></div>\n          <p class=\"end-mark__label\">本页完</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <section class=\"kp-extend\">\n          <h3 class=\"kp-h3\">延伸</h3>\n          <p class=\"kp-extend__desc\">第四章 几何图形初步中的立体图形支持三维演示。</p>\n          <a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"concept-3d.html\" data-dom-id=\"open-3d\">打开三维演示 →</a>\n        </section>"
}
